   "_dt": 1795139223.0,
   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "Hyundai Motor said Friday it has unveiled its eighth-generation Avante compact sedan, known as the Elantra in North America, and the Genesis G80 Hybrid at the Los Angeles Auto Show. The Korean automaker showcased the all-new 2027 Elantra and 2028 Elantra Hybrid during a media preview of the auto show at the Los Angeles Convention Center in California. Genesis, Hyundai Motor's luxury brand, also unveiled the G80 Hybrid with enhanced power output and fuel efficiency.",
   "summary_zh": "现代汽车周五表示，公司已在洛杉矶汽车展上发布第八代 Avante 紧凑型轿车（该车型在北美称为 Elantra）以及 Genesis G80 混合动力版。这家韩国汽车制造商在加利福尼亚州洛杉矶会展中心举行的媒体预展上展示了全新 2027 款 Elantra 和 2028 款 Elantra 混合动力版。现代汽车的豪华品牌 Genesis 还发布了动力输出和燃油效率均有所提升的 G80 混合动力版。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Hyundai Motor said Friday it has unveiled its eighth-generation Avante compact sedan, known as the Elantra in North America, and the Genesis G80 Hybrid at the Los Angeles Auto Show. The Korean automaker showcased the all-new 2027 Elantra and 2028 Elantra Hybrid during a media preview of the auto show at the Los Angeles Convention Center in California. The all-new Elantra will be available with two powertrain options: a 2.0-liter gasoline engine and a 1.6-liter hybrid powertrain. Genesis, Hyundai Motor's luxury brand, also unveiled the G80 Hybrid with enhanced power output and fuel efficiency. The G80 Hybrid combines a 2.5-liter turbocharged gasoline engine with a dual-motor hybrid system, offering a driving range of approximately 1,029 kilometers on a single tank of fuel. The model also features a liquid-cooled battery system for improved thermal efficiency and higher discharge power compared with air-cooled systems",
