   "title": "Seoul subway union launches 'work-to-rule' campaign over hiring, wage dispute",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261120/seoul-subway-union-launches-work-to-rule-campaign-over-hiring-wage-dispute",
