   "title": "Experts warn 2-state approach could make Korean division permanent",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/society/20261120/experts-warn-2-state-approach-could-make-korean-division-permanent",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
