   "title": "Makinde Campaign faults Tinubu over federal recruitment embargo",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/makinde-campaign-faults-tinubu-over-federal-recruitment-embargo/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
