   "title": "ASEAN Summit LIVE updates: PM Modi at ASEAN-India Summit; Quad meeting likely after President Trump arrives",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/asean-india-summit-manila-november-2026-quad-live-updates-pm-modi-trump-meeting-latest-news/article71710382.ece",
